# House Hlaalu: "people cannot read" (HH_LiteracyCampaign), Ilmeni Dren, Vivec.
# Ilmeni asks for "ABCs for Barbarians" and "The Annotated Anuad" (10), bought at Jobasha's Rare Books (AddItem and
# 75 gold stand in for the barter); Vala Catraso at the Ald'ruhn Mages Guild takes them ("Yes, here they are" 1:
# 50); Ilmeni (100).
# PositionCell + `approach` stand in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_literacy
run
player->PositionCell 417 -412 -103 0 "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One" == 1
approach 052DA0B7
talk ilmeni dren
ask business
ask people cannot read
expect GetJournalIndex HH_LiteracyCampaign == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 883 -243 -408 0 "Vivec, Jobasha's Rare Books"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Jobasha's Rare Books" == 1
run
player->RemoveItem Gold_001 75
player->AddItem bk_ABCs 1
player->AddItem bk_AnnotatedAnuad 1
run
player->PositionCell 1673 953 -632 0 "Ald-ruhn, Guild of Mages"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, Guild of Mages" == 1
approach 058AF44E
talk vala catraso
ask people cannot read
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_LiteracyCampaign == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 417 -412 -103 0 "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One" == 1
approach 052DA0B7
talk ilmeni dren
ask people cannot read
expect GetJournalIndex HH_LiteracyCampaign == 100
bye
end
